{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jinwoo is an ordinary child who lives his daily life without any special talents. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489930/extras/talk_body_00000.png?t=1756508917\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the track at the elementary school playground piques his curiosity. <br><br>Unable to bear the boredom any longer, Jinwoo starts running like crazy, and his goal is to complete the track by running 3 laps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489930/extras/background_last.png?t=1756508917\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other games, in 'Runners', Jinwoo communicates directly with the player and leads the game. The player must help Jinwoo not stop by quickly typing commands that appear in succession.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489930/extras/image.png?t=1756508917\" /></span><br><br>Not a single mistake is tolerated, and the game ends the moment Jinwoo stops. <br><strong><u><br>Don't stop, keep running!</u></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489930?t=1756508917","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489930/e31d96976186175007f87e8a137412cd1e94ecee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756508917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489930/e4941b942893b2d36c585c1e91d4dca1e021410d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756508917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489930/e4941b942893b2d36c585c1e91d4dca1e021410d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756508917","categories":[{